# Mini Social Network

A simple Mini Social Network developed using C programming and a singly linked list.
The project allows users to register, login, follow other users, and manage followers.

## Features

- Register a new user
- Login with username and password
- Follow other users
- View followers
- View following users
- Unfollow users
- Remove followers
- Logout

## Data Structure

- `struct User` is used to store user information.
- A singly linked list is used to store the list of users.
- Arrays are used to store followers and following users.

## Technologies Used

- C Programming
- Structures
- Singly Linked List
- Arrays
- Dynamic Memory Allocation
- Functions

